<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were steady to $0.50 lower. Demand was light to moderate. Top $50.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 49.00-50.00, few 48.50 &amp; 50.50.</p>
<p>Sows - mostly off 1.50-2.00. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   300-400 lbs. 39.50-42.00</p>
<p>		 400-500 lbs. 41.50-44.00, few 45.00</p>
<p>		 500-600 lbs. 44.50-47.00</p>
<p>		 few over 600 lbs. 46.50-48.50, few 49.00</p>
</text>
